      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} Every time I open VR chat it loads me into my account I get it gets through the connecting but then every time I'm loading into my world when it says join it just freezes and doesn't let me go past join and my game isn't Frozen and it won't let me go into the world and I have done everything I have found I have restarted your chat I have uninstalled and reinstalled my game I have restarted my Oculus but none of it seems to work and it's not a Wi-Fi problem and I factory reset my Oculus and that still didn't work I was able to log in one time and that one time that I could log in when I tried to invite someone or try to join someone they never got the invite and my videos my URL videos don't work they won't load or play sound but my main thing is every time I open VR chat it does not load and it keeps me on the joining screen and I've sat there for almost 2 hours and no progress and it has been almost a week and a half since this started happening and I've tried every solution that I've found the solutions that you guys have gave and nothing seems to work so I would like to see if you guys could fix it somehow I really hope you can because love this game and I hope you guys get back to me soon",
